      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can't recommend that dosing — 800mg every 4 hours exceeds safe over-the-counter guidelines and puts you at risk of stomach bleeding and kidney damage, especially over multiple days. Instead, you could take 400mg every 6-8 hours with food, and try heat or cold packs during short breaks. If your pain is severe enough to need prescription-strength dosing, it's worth a call to your doctor, who can prescribe something safer for a short flare and possibly faster-acting.",
